Algorithm MergeSortedLists(head1, head2)

1. If head1 = NULL
       Return head2

2. If head2 = NULL
       Return head1

3. If head1 → data < head2 → data
       head ← head1
       head → next ← MergeSortedLists(head1 → next, head2)
   Else
       head ← head2
       head → next ← MergeSortedLists(head1, head2 → next)

4. Return head

5. Stop